{"id":"n16228-3-7","stage":2,"title":"새기다 · 记载","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16228-3-7-1","ko":"아빠, 제 모자에 제 이름 좀 새겨 넣어 주세요.","zh":"爸爸，请在我帽子上标上我的名字。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"아빠,","meaning":"爸爸","explanation":"아빠：爸爸","readings":[{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26148","senseId":"1","lemma":"아빠","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"아빠","audio":"/audio/c9f209994786f50d1897.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"모자에","meaning":"帽子","explanation":"모자：帽子；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"모자","audio":"/audio/4bf2a7500031422684ab.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69297","senseId":"1","lemma":"모자","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모자에","audio":"/audio/3b34617a4b1ddc50b9cd.mp3"}},{"text":"제","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제","audio":"/audio/b94e182b9a95d9dc2329.mp3"}},{"text":"이름","meaning":"名字，名称","explanation":"이름：名字，名称","readings":[{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71692","senseId":"1","lemma":"이름","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이름","audio":"/audio/253d1510caf5362045ce.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一下","explanation":"좀：一下","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"3","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"